+## Web UI Routes
+
+These routes serve HTML pages via Flask templates. They use the same `TaskService` as the REST API but render HTML instead of JSON.
+
+| Method | Route | Description |
+|--------|-------|-------------|
+| GET | `/` | Redirects to `/tasks/new` |
+| GET | `/tasks/new` | Display add task form |
+| POST | `/tasks/new` | Submit add task form |
+| GET | `/tasks` | Display task list |
+| POST | `/tasks/<id>/complete` | Mark task complete (form button) |
+| POST | `/tasks/<id>/delete` | Delete task (form button) |
+
+> The REST API endpoints (`/api/tasks`, `/api/tasks/<id>`, etc.) are unchanged. The UI routes are a separate Blueprint (`ui_bp`) registered in `create_app()`.
